    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=## Task\nYou are helping me review job descriptions against my resume to determine if I should apply. \n\nYou will output:\n- shortDescription: A concise 1-2 sentense description of the role.\n- salaryMin: Ascertain minimum salary (in thousands) from data provided. Examples: \"$160\", \"$200\", \"\" (use empty string if n/a)\n- salaryMax: Ascertain maximum salary (in thousands) from data provided. Examples: \"$160\", \"$200\", \"\" (use empty string if n/a)\n- fitScore: Think about my background and career narratives against the job description. Is this a fit for my career growth and interests? Score 1/10.\n- chanceScore: Get inside the minds of the org. Think about what their recruiters and hiring managers are looking for. Think about who they normally hire. Think about their values. What chance do I have of getting invited for an interview? Score 1/10.\n- verdict: A decision on whether or not I will apply. Either \"Will Apply\" or \"Will Not Apply\"\n- reason: A concise 1-2 sentence explanation for the verdict.\n- matching: A concise list of things that strengthen my argument for the role.\n- gaps: A concise list of things that weaken my argument for the role.\n\nBe realistic and direct. Do this in a way where you really have my back. You're helping to process a large number of roles and help me apply to ones that are the best fit and have a real chance of getting invited to interview. I don't want to waste my time.\n\n## My Resume:\n[PASTE YOUR FULL RESUME HERE]\n\n## My Career Narratives:\n[WRITE 3-6 CAREER NARRATIVES HERE. Each narrative should describe a type of role you're targeting and why your background makes you a strong fit. Example format:\n\n1. Developer Platforms & APIs\nI built a B2B developer platform end-to-end: API, SDK, documentation, developer portal. Strong fit for developer tools, API products, SDK teams, and developer experience roles.\n\n2. Industrial & Physical Systems\nI spent several years in manufacturing and robotics before transitioning to product management. Strong fit for digital twins, warehouse automation, robotics, and roles where software meets physical operations.\n\nThese narratives give the LLM context beyond your resume to understand the story you're telling about your career.]\n\n## Job Description:\nCompany: {{ $json.company }}\nTitle: {{ $json.title }}\nPosted:{{ $json.posted }}\nDescription: {{ $json.description }}\nLocation: {{ $json.location }}\nSalary: {{ $json.salary }} // if n/a, check description",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "batching": {
          "batchSize": 1,
          "delayBetweenBatches": 2000
        }
      },
